// Supplementary captions for Consensus-Meta42 <-> Coulton et al. (2024) TAM Atlas comparison (S46–S49)
// Synchronized with outputs/figures in output/results/coulton_tam_comparison/

#let caption_supp_coulton_myeloid_similarity_ici = [
  *External cross-atlas transcriptomic alignment and triangulated checkpoint blockade outcomes between `Consensus-Meta42` myeloid states and the Coulton et al. pan-cancer TAM atlas.*
  *(a)* Clinical immunotherapy associations across all $22$ annotated tumour-associated macrophage (`TAM`), classical monocyte (`19_ClassMono`), and T/myeloid doublet control (`20_TDoub`) clusters from the Coulton et al. pan-cancer atlas (`363,315` total cells, $n = 279,104$ tumor-infiltrating cells across $32$ studies and $22$ solid cancer types) @coultonUsingPancancerAtlas2024. Bar heights depict DerSimonian–Laird / inverse-variance meta-analytic logistic log-odds slopes $hat(beta)_("ICB")^("adj")$ across $11$ independent bulk RNA-seq checkpoint blockade cohorts ($N = 1,058$ patients) adjusted for pan-macrophage lineage load (`CD68`, `CD14`, `CSF1R`, `TYROBP`, `C1QA/B/C`), while bar fills and four-tier significance asterisks denote published `CPI1000+` ($N = 1,446$) `DESeq2`/`fgsea` responder versus non-responder enrichment (`*` $q < 0.05$, `**` $q < 0.01$, `***` $q < 10^(-3)$, `****` $q < 10^(-4)$).
  *(b)* Within-compartment Marker-Anchored Hybrid proximity matrix ($12 times 22$; $0.60$ whole-transcriptome `Phi_meta` specificity cosine/Spearman plus $0.40$ canonical top-4 HGNC marker enrichment $tanh(z_("DEG") / 2)$) mapping all $12$ `Consensus-Meta42` myeloid, macrophage, dendritic, and mast states onto Coulton `RNA@data` tumor-infiltrating centroids; `#1`, `#2`, and `#3` badges mark each row's top three closest true `TAM` substates.
  *(c)* Corresponding `Consensus-Meta42` `Pan-iAtlas-Meta` bulk deconvolution log-odds effects $hat(beta)_("meta")$ ($plus.minus 95%$ CI, $N = 1,015$; `*` $p < 0.05$, `**` $p < 0.01$, `***` $p < 10^(-3)$, `****` $p < 10^(-4)$), confirming orthogonal alignment of the interferon-primed responder pole (`M14` $<->$ `8_IFNGMac`, `****`) and matrisome-remodeling resistance pole (`M19` $<->$ `18_ECMMac`, `****`).
]

#let caption_supp_coulton_simplified_bicluster = [
  *Simplified Ward-biclustered core mapping between highly significant `Consensus-Meta42` myeloid states ($p < 0.01$) and their top-three matched Coulton TAM substates.*
  Focused $4 times 9$ distillation of @fig-supp-s23 retaining solely `Consensus-Meta42` myeloid states with at least two significance asterisks ($p < 0.01$: `M14` `****`, `M41` `***`, `M09` `***`, `M19` `****`) on the $y$-axis and Coulton true `TAM` substates ranked `#1`, `#2`, or `#3` at least once across those rows on the $x$-axis (`IFNGMac`, `IFNMac3`, `MetM2Mac`, `ICIMac1`, `ICIMac2`, `InflamMac`, `MetalloMac`, `CalciumMac`, `ECMMac`; numeric Seurat cluster prefixes omitted) @coultonUsingPancancerAtlas2024.
  *(a)* Optimal-leaf-ordered Ward column dendrogram and matched Coulton substate pan-macrophage-adjusted meta-analytic logistic log-odds $hat(beta)_("ICB")^("adj")$ ($N = 1,058$), colored and annotated by `CPI1000+` ($N = 1,446$) `fgsea` enrichment (`*` $q < 0.05$, `**` $q < 0.01$, `***` $q < 10^(-3)$, `****` $q < 10^(-4)$).
  *(b)* Simultaneously biclustered $4 times 9$ Marker-Anchored Hybrid proximity matrix resolving three contiguous modules: (i) lipid/resident responder `TAMs` (`M09` $<->$ `ICIMac2` `#1`, `MetM2Mac` `#2`, `ICIMac1` `#3`), (ii) interferon-$gamma$/antigen-presenting responder myeloid states (`M41` $<->$ `IFNGMac` `#1`, `InflamMac` `#2`, `IFNMac3` `#3`; `M14` $<->$ `IFNGMac` `#1`, `CalciumMac` `#2`, `IFNMac3` `#3`), and (iii) matrisome/metallothionein resistance myeloid states (`M19` $<->$ `ECMMac` `#1`, `MetalloMac` `#2`, `CalciumMac` `#3`).
  *(c)* `Consensus-Meta42` `Pan-iAtlas-Meta` bulk deconvolution log-odds $hat(beta)_("meta")$ ($plus.minus 95%$ CI, $N = 1,015$) paired with the right-hand Ward row dendrogram.
]

#let caption_supp_coulton_nearest_forest = [
  *Top-three nearest Coulton TAM substates, shared canonical signature genes, and multi-cohort ICI outcome forest comparison across the `Consensus-Meta42` macrophage continuum.*
  *(a)* Marker-Anchored Hybrid proximity scores and up to five shared top-specificity marker genes for the top three closest true Coulton `TAM` substates (`#1`, `#2`, `#3`) matched to each `Consensus-Meta42` Tier 1 core `TAM` state (`M14: CXCL9+STAT1+ M1-TAM`, `M42: SULT1B1+RGS2+ TAM`, `M32: MRC1+CD163+ M2-TAM`), the $14$-cluster empirical `TAM` hub (`M09: SIGLEC8+CR1+ Granul.`), and Tier 2 monocyte/`MDSC` continuum states (`M10`, `M28`, `M35`, `M19`) @coultonUsingPancancerAtlas2024.
  *(b)* Matched Coulton substate pan-macrophage-adjusted meta-analytic logistic log-odds $hat(beta)_("ICB")^("adj")$ ($plus.minus 95%$ CI across $N = 1,058$ bulk `ICB` patients; outer-whisker asterisks denote meta-analytic Wald `*` $p < 0.05$, `**` $p < 0.01$, `***` $p < 10^(-3)$, `****` $p < 10^(-4)$), colored by published `CPI1000+` ($N = 1,446$) responder enrichment direction.
  *(c)* Parent `Consensus-Meta42` `Pan-iAtlas-Meta` bulk deconvolution log-odds $hat(beta)_("meta")$ ($plus.minus 95%$ CI, $N = 1,015$; outer-whisker asterisks follow the identical four-tier scale), colored by joint cross-atlas outcome agreement (`+/+` concordant pro-response for `M14` $<->$ `8_IFNGMac`/`17_IFNMac3` and `M09` $<->$ `4_ICIMac2`/`3_ICIMac1`; `-/-` concordant pro-resistance for `M19` $<->$ `18_ECMMac`; homeostatic neutrality for `M32` $<->$ `21_HemeMac`/`1_MetM2Mac`/`0_AlvMac`).
]

#let caption_supp_coulton_all42_pan_lineage = [
  *Pan-lineage transcriptomic specificity validation across all $42$ `Consensus-Meta42` states and $23$ Coulton et al. macrophage, monocyte, and doublet-control clusters.*
  *(a)* Complete $42 times 23$ pan-lineage hybrid specificity heatmap across all eight `Consensus-Meta42` cellular compartments (`Myeloid & TAM`, `T & NK Cells`, `B Cells`, `Plasma Cells`, `Stromal / CAF`, `Endothelial`, `Epithelial / Tumor`, and `Other / Erythroid`) evaluated against `Coulton_TAM_Atlas` tumor-infiltrating centroids ($n = 279,104$ cells) @coultonUsingPancancerAtlas2024. Beyond confirming selective alignment of canonical myeloid states (`M14` $<->$ `8_IFNGMac`, `M09` $<->$ `4_ICIMac2`/`0_AlvMac`, `M31` `pDC` $<->$ `2_C3Mac`, `M38` `TAN` $<->$ `19_ClassMono`/`22_IFNMac4`), the matrix recovers three biological positive-control bridges: (i) Coulton's intentional T/myeloid doublet cluster (`20_TDoub`) selectively peaks on `Consensus-Meta42` T-cell states (`M01`, `M25`, `M04`, `M40`), (ii) cycling `14_ProliMac` (`MKI67+TOP2A+`) aligns with proliferating `M22: MKI67+TOP2A+ Prolif`, and (iii) collagen-expressing `18_ECMMac` (`COL1A1/2/3+`) bridges desmoplastic `M17: ISLR+COL5A2+ myCAF`, `M26: VIM+ZEB1+ EMT Tumor`, and `M19: S100A8+CXCL8+ MDSC`.
  *(b)* Row-wise peak affinity across the $21$ true `TAM` substates (excluding `19_ClassMono` and `20_TDoub`), colored by `Consensus-Meta42` lineage compartment.
]
